      "title": "About Bulletproof React",
      "path": "/",
      "content": "Bulletproof React showcases best practices for building React applications. This demo is a team discussions app: create an account for your team, then read and take part in team-scoped discussion threads with comments. Use \"Get started\" on the landing page to sign in. Source code: https://github.com/alan2207/bulletproof-react."
    },
    {
      "title": "Your profile and team",
      "path": "/app/profile",
      "content": "The profile page shows your first name, last name, email and bio. The users page at /app/users lists the team's members and is visible to admins only."
    },
    {
      "title": "Creating an account and signing in",
      "path": "/auth/register",
      "content": "Register with first name, last name, email and a password (minimum 5 characters). Pick one of two team options: enter a Team Name to create a new team — you become that team's ADMIN — or toggle \"Join Existing Team\" and select a team to join as a regular USER (member). Existing accounts log in with email and password at /auth/login. Signing in is required for the app area: dashboard, discussions and comments."
    }
  ]
}

